#==============================================================================================
#
#   table_wrapper - Layout::TableWrapper: the anonymous block around a table box
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/TableWrapper.cpp (lines 1-25) and TableWrapper.h: the box the
#       TreeBuilder wraps every table root in (https://www.w3.org/TR/css-tables-3/#table-wrapper-box),
#       a block container that holds the table box and its captions.
